{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\nアンダーライブ ～中国シリーズ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初日でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島県ということで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バウムクーヘン\nもみじまんじゅう\nれもんケーキ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん\nお好み焼きもいっぱい食べました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/23/9135980/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなかライブをやらない場所だし\n中国地方来れて本当に良かったー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/23/9135980/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ始まったばかりに\n言うことでもないんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東北シリーズは全県回ったけど\n今回は中国地方の3県だけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから\n中国シリーズじゃなくて\n山陽シリーズってことにして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか山陰シリーズもやりたいなって思った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏のツアーでも行かないような場所にも行く\nっていうのが\nアンダーライブの良さでもあると思うし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかくなら全都道府県制覇したい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってちょっと思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/23/9135980/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\n最初っからみなさんが元気で\nすごく盛り上がってくれて\nびっくりしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観に来てくれて本当にありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も頑張ってきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/23/9135980/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/23/9135980/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てことで\n今日の沈金出れません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出たかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/23/9135980/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰がアシスタントMCするかは\nお楽しみに～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}